Absolute Suite v@BUNDLE_VERSION@ Beta
====================================

One guided installer for Absolute Control and the modular Absolute ecosystem.
Absolute Control is always installed. The FOMOD lets you select HOTAS flight
control, ship-power management, OpenTrack head tracking, and mouse steering.

Each gameplay module remains an independent SFSE plugin with its own runtime,
configuration, version, and standalone release. The bundle does not merge
plugins or move gameplay ownership into Absolute Control.


